stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Closed
    Closed --> Opening: a sensor sees something\nfor 0.3 s in a row
    Opening --> Open: reached open position\n(~4–6 s)
    Open --> Open: still seeing him\n(20 s timer restarts)
    Open --> Closing: both sensors clear\nfor 20 s
    Open --> Closing: open 2 min straight\n(stuck sensor ignored\nuntil it clears)
    Closing --> Opening: sensor sees something\n→ reverse immediately
    Closing --> Cooldown: fully closed,\ncord slack again
    Cooldown --> Closed: after 3 s
